# E2E (Playwright)

```bash
pnpm test:e2e          # Next dev port 3005 + Playwright headless
pnpm test:e2e:ui
```

- Login route: `/login/` (not `/auth/login`)
- Auth cookie: `auth_token`
- Specs: `tests/e2e/**/*.spec.ts`
- Page objects: `tests/e2e/pages/{module}/*Page.ts` — `getByTestId` only
- After `goto`: `assertLayoutIntegrity(page)` when layout shell present

Doc: `docs/operational/E2E-TESTIDS.md`
